<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακῑν-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move aside, disturb</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				591e
			</span></i> (unless intr., v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				11.2
			</span></i>): abs., <i>raise troubles, enter into conspiracies</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				15.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh. Pr.</u>
				5
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κινοῦν μέρος</span> the
				<i>revolutionary</i> element, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>excite violently, madden</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.19.1
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be distracted</i>, Arg.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>
			<i>to be violently excited</i> or <i>incited</i> to . . , <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hist. Conscr.</u>
				1
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόθερμος καὶ παρακεκινημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cal.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			 ; later, simply, <i>urge</i>, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mantiss.Prov.</u>
				2.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stir up</i>, i.e. <i>raise a question about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἀριστοτέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.656c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr., <i>to
				be disturbed, become turbid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.7.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shift one's ground, change</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				54o
			</span></i>a, <i><span class="en">
				591e
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				1.1
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>to be highly excited</i> or <i>impassioned</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῖς ὡραίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.2.35
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὰς ἡδονάς</span>
			Theopomp. Hist.<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδὲν παρακινέειν</span>
			<i>feel</i> no sexual <i>impulse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i> ; of political unrest, <i>to be in a state of ferment</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ τάγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Galb.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>to be out of one's senses</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρακεκινηκὼς ὑφ᾽ ἡλικίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					885
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νουθετεῖται . . ὡς
			παρακινῶν</span> as <i>out of his senses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				249d
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ διανοίᾳ παρακεκινηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					24.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.14
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
